Z||000000||turbo86se||12-10-2001||08:42 PM||||Just wanted to share with ya'll, here's my baby,<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/'86SE_Williamsburg.jpg"> <BR>Sorry about the huge pic, haven't figured that out yet. Anyways, 55K miles, auto, MillerWoods turbo running 9lbs boost, decklid scoop, ported and polished Jet Hot coated manifolds. 16" 7-spoke wheels. Koni shocks and struts. ST lowering springs, hasn't seen rain in 5 years. <BR>This pic was taken in Williamsburg, on Colonial Parkway at the show this past summer. LMK what you think!!<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SC.jpg"> ||||reg||1
